Recommends:
  rng-tools5 | jitterentropy-rngd
Description: Generic baseline system hardening for Debian
  Provides universal system security hardening applicable to both server
  and desktop deployments. Configures kernel self-protection parameters,
  disables core dumps, system restrictions, and password complexity.
